# launch-choir-synthesis-chapter.rish -- print the recipe for CHOIR, the synthesis launch.
#
# Choir is the seventh launch and it is not a seventh hand. The six bodies are three
# presence-and-absence pairs -- Mind with Mystery, Sound with Silence, Dream with Hush -- and a
# choir is the one thing all six are together: many voices, and the rests between them, performing
# one piece in one sitting. The tree already uses the word for exactly this shape -- a choir is one
# witness that sings a whole family of rungs in one invocation (standing-equipment tiers) -- so the
# name teaches its own meaning, which is the Comlink tendency's whole test. Seated on Keaton's word
# 20260827: "make a 7th synthesis launch with a new synthesis name from the 6 names."
#
# THE ONE PRECONDITION, and why it is the whole safety story: CHOIR RUNS ONLY WHEN ALL SIX LOOPS
# ARE STOPPED. One hand performs every lane in one bounded round -- six inner laps, one outer loop
# around them all -- so the multi-hand collision the charter guards against (REDS %281, %291)
# cannot occur: there is exactly one hand, holding all six lanes at once, and it opens and closes
# the round the way any single loop does. Choir is for the quiet hour: the loops rest, one
# synthesis round sweeps every lane forward a step, and the loops wake to a fresher tree.
#
# Charter: active-designing/20260827-155213_the-six-bodies-and-the-closed-stacks.md (the seventh
# seat section). Lexicon: the Choir row.
#
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/l/launch-choir-synthesis-chapter.rish

# invariant: run from the repo root, where the durable memory lives.
let root = run ["test" "-f" "construction/ITINERARY.md"]
assert root.ok else "run from the repo root (construction/ITINERARY.md not found)"

# invariant: the living charter this seat lives in must exist.
let charter = run ["test" "-f" "active-designing/20260827-155213_the-six-bodies-and-the-closed-stacks.md"]
assert charter.ok else "the six-bodies charter is missing"

say "CHOIR -- the synthesis launch (six voices, one performance)"
say "==========================================================="
say ""
say "Host: any single capable hand -- Claude Code at max effort, or a supervised"
say "Codex session -- on any machine holding this clone. Choir is a LAUNCH, not a"
say "loop: it runs one round and ends. No sentinel, no sleep-and-repeat."
say ""
say "0) PRECONDITION, checked by a hand rather than a flag: ALL SIX LOOPS ARE"
say "   STOPPED. Ask the terminal multiplexers, ask ListAgents, ask Keaton."
say "   A Choir round beside a live loop is two hands in one lane, which is"
say "   the exact thing the six-body design exists to prevent."
say ""
say "1) THE ROUND -- one outer loop wrapped around six inner laps:"
say "   open:  sh tools/f/fleet_round_open.sh; read the card and the newest shelf rows."
say "   sing:  one bounded lap PER LANE, each inside its own rooms --"
say "          Mind: Brushstroke and Surf/Skate           Mystery: the carried surface (TUBE pack, AppImage)"
say "          Sound: interface Glow (Realidream, Lantern) Silence: infrastructure (Mantra, Comlink, Tablecloth)"
say "          Dream: the systems core (Caravan, Tally)    Hush: Pond and the adaptation grant"
say "          Lanes stay disjoint on disk, so the six laps may run in parallel"
say "          under one supervisor; findings that cross a lane become card lines,"
say "          never another lane's edit -- the orbit rule, held even solo."
say "   close: reds booked centrally by the one hand (never from inside a lane),"
say "          one session log born on the day's shelf, one send the twice-pulled way."
say ""
say "2) CUSTODY: every gate on the card stays MANUAL -- funds and keys, provisioning"
say "   and paying, the maintainer's identity, the public seed. A Choir round has"
say "   more reach than any single loop, which is a reason for more care, never less."
say ""
say "MANY HANDS (granted 20260828, Keaton's word): the one supervising hand may"
say "spin up multiple CLI agents and manage them -- one child per lane, running"
say "the six inner laps in parallel under the one supervisor. Reds still book"
say "centrally, the lanes stay disjoint on disk, custody gates stay MANUAL, and"
say "one session log and one send close the round."
say ""
say "GREEN: Choir recipe printed -- when the six rest, one voice may carry all six parts, once."
